        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I suppose the new functions would become something like `move_buf_prev()` and `move_buf_next()`, and `:bprev/:bnext` would just keep on existing and functioning like they do :)\r\n\r\nYes, something like `move_left()`/`move_right()`. But on top of that, there should be functionality to switch focus on next/previous buffer in current tab order: `next_tab()`/`prev_tab()` (or `goto_left()`/`goto_right()`).",
